      "sourceRuleId": "hub:filter-tag:guidelines.md:32",
      "manualRuleIds": [],
      "route": "documentation-or-context",
      "compiledRuleIds": []
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/ds-ai-hub/core/web/components/filter-tag/guidelines.md:33",
      "sourceNorm": "- Выбор из короткого видимого списка без выпадашки → [`Tag`](../tag/guidelines.md) / [`CheckboxGroup`](../checkbox-group/guidelines.md) / [`RadioGroup`](../radio-group/guidelines.md) (`core/common/patterns/control-selection.md`).",
      "section": "Когда не использовать",
      "sourceRuleId": "hub:filter-tag:guidelines.md:33",
      "manualRuleIds": [],
      "route": "documentation-or-context",
      "compiledRuleIds": []
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/ds-ai-hub/core/web/components/filter-tag/guidelines.md:34",
      "sourceNorm": "- Поле ввода с тегами внутри → [`SelectWithTags`](../select-with-tags/guidelines.md).",
      "section": "Когда не использовать",
      "sourceRuleId": "hub:filter-tag:guidelines.md:34",
      "manualRuleIds": [],
      "route": "documentation-or-context",
      "compiledRuleIds": []
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/alexkukhta/Desktop/workplace/ds-ai-hub/core/web/components/filter-tag/guidelines.md:35",
      "sourceNorm": "- Декоративный статус → [`StatusBadge`](../status-badge/guidelines.md).",
      "section": "Когда не использовать",
      "sourceRuleId": "hub:filter-tag:guidelines.md:35",
      "manualRuleIds": [],
